window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>A merry mated matrimony…</i></b></p> <p>All I want for Christmas is my two front teeth. Well, okay, literally speaking I want these two legs I’m standing on to be permanent. I want my scales to not pop up if it rains or if someone spills their drink on me. I want a house on land and a pet that has fur instead of two rows of razor sharp teeth. I’ve always felt like a crab out of her shell except when I’m on land. Except sirens can’t control their shifting.</p> <p>But I found the loophole, the key to gaining my freedom and the life I’ve always wanted.</p> <p>Now I just have to find a guy willing to marry me.</p> <p><b>*Part of a mini-series but can be listened to as a standalone, in any order with the others.</b></p>"; 
